		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Fleshy, lumpy, crawling corpse, hungry for flesh.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 9, <strong>HP</strong> 15, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 slam +1 (1d6), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> -1, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> -2, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 3</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Reduced to Salt</strong>. If slain by fire, doused with holy water, or targeted by bless or restoration, turns to salt.</p><p></p><p><strong>Rise Again</strong>. If reduced to 0 HP and not reduced to salt, rises again after 1 round and regains 3d6 HP.</p><p></p><p><strong>Undead</strong>. Immune to morale checks.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
